  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nsqrt{1+(x³)/(9)}=5\n\n \n\n**Calculations:**\n\n⇒ 1 + x³ / 9 = 25\n\n⇒ x3 / 9 = 25 - 1\n\n⇒ x3 / 9 = 24\n\n⇒ x3 = 24 × 9\n\n⇒ x3 = 216\n\n⇒ x = ∛216\n\n⇒ x = 6\n\n**∴ The value of x is 6.**",
